WEBVTT

00:23.840 --> 00:28.840
I WAS REINCARNATED AS THE 7TH PRINCE SO I CAN TAKE
MY TIME PERFECTING MY MAGICAL ABILITY 2ND SEASON

01:45.460 --> 01:50.760
EPISODE 16: CIVIL WAR

01:55.760 --> 01:59.389
Does anyone have an idea
what just happened to us?

01:59.390 --> 02:04.060
If you're suggesting we all took a spill at
the same time, then that's kind of a stretch.

02:06.770 --> 02:10.110
Wait... is this... But it can't be...

02:12.110 --> 02:13.489
You stupid—

02:13.490 --> 02:14.970
He extended something.

02:18.010 --> 02:20.330
Again?! Why am I sitting?!

02:23.830 --> 02:26.710
That was just, uh... my legs kinda went...

02:28.090 --> 02:31.210
Well, my arms haven't been
working right, either.

02:31.670 --> 02:33.720
So, we don't even know
what's happening to us.

02:34.220 --> 02:36.219
Doesn't get much worse.

02:36.220 --> 02:37.759
Oh, no.

02:37.760 --> 02:40.470
This power...
but that shouldn't be possible...

02:54.280 --> 02:54.570
RIP

02:55.990 --> 02:58.489
He just dodges three combined
sneak attacks, huh?

02:58.490 --> 03:00.579
This is starting to get depressing.

03:00.580 --> 03:02.500
Spinal cords and automatic reflexes.

03:03.620 --> 03:06.120
Get a load of this.
It's fascinating.

03:07.580 --> 03:09.249
TWITCH
Kinda looks like...

03:09.250 --> 03:11.129
TWITCH
Incredibly thin bone?

03:11.130 --> 03:14.630
It's a spinal thread.
That's what he was extending.

03:15.040 --> 03:18.160
I'm sure of it now! This has to be...

03:19.370 --> 03:21.179
The Neuron Blighted?

03:21.180 --> 03:21.910
Yeah.

03:22.790 --> 03:25.349
He's a Blighted born
in a small province...

03:25.350 --> 03:30.490
And his body apparently produces an endless
strand of spinal threads, made from mana.

03:31.800 --> 03:35.239
When they would make contact
with someone else's limbs,

03:35.240 --> 03:40.659
they'd interfere with their motor nerves,
and override the brain's commands.

03:40.660 --> 03:41.989
THROW SCISSORS

03:41.990 --> 03:45.499
On top of that, the spinal threads
wrapped around his skin

03:45.500 --> 03:49.329
have mana signatures for evasion
and counter-attack etched onto them,

03:49.330 --> 03:52.120
which means he can move faster
than the speed of thought...

03:53.010 --> 03:57.880
He was sent into battle in order to quell
a civil war that was raging in the country.

03:58.350 --> 04:00.090
Like a biological weapon...

04:00.520 --> 04:03.350
They treated a Blighted like a weapon?!

04:04.020 --> 04:07.889
He couldn't control his power
any more than we can,

04:07.890 --> 04:10.100
but he tipped the balance of power.

04:10.810 --> 04:14.649
Tearing through anyone he came in
contact with, friend and foe alike...

04:14.650 --> 04:20.110
Even after being shot through the heart,
he continued to kill on automated reflex.

04:20.700 --> 04:24.579
Having become both untouchable
and the walking dead,

04:24.580 --> 04:28.040
they had to blow off a chunk of a cliff
in order to send him into the sea.

04:28.660 --> 04:32.020
As his body sank
below the raging waves,

04:32.570 --> 04:34.910
he continued to struggle
the entire time...

04:36.810 --> 04:40.969
Hey, you're right! Now that I know
what to look for, I can see tiny strings!

04:40.970 --> 04:42.179
But this doesn't make sense!

04:42.180 --> 04:43.509
He was said to have died,

04:43.510 --> 04:43.799
RIP
and sunk into the sea!

04:43.800 --> 04:44.599
and sunk into the sea!

04:44.600 --> 04:46.769
But if what you said is true,

04:46.770 --> 04:48.489
then even after death,

04:48.490 --> 04:49.349
his body continued to move, correct?

04:49.350 --> 04:49.689
RIP
his body continued to move, correct?

04:49.690 --> 04:50.389
his body continued to move, correct?

04:50.390 --> 04:53.229
That would've been automatic,
mechanical reflexes!

04:53.230 --> 04:55.399
Nothing as... clever as this.

04:55.400 --> 04:57.079
It shouldn't be possible.

04:57.080 --> 04:59.649
So, did the washed up
body turn into a ghoul?

04:59.650 --> 05:03.280
Because I've never heard of a ghoul
retaining memories of its life.

05:03.820 --> 05:07.039
We don't have time to wonder
about it! Here he comes!

05:07.040 --> 05:10.669
And now that we know the trick,
dodging a few strings

05:10.670 --> 05:11.790
should be easy!

05:13.420 --> 05:14.419
There are...

05:14.420 --> 05:15.670
...too damn many!

05:16.010 --> 05:16.959
BEND THE KNEE

05:16.960 --> 05:18.049
FALL ONTO YOUR HEAD

05:18.050 --> 05:19.420
DON'T BREAK YOUR FALL

05:24.710 --> 05:28.780
What are you doing?!

05:29.730 --> 05:34.399
Master, if I have to possess a body,
I'd rather it be a sweet one like hers.

05:34.400 --> 05:38.070
That's quite all right.
I'll dispose of this trash, then.

05:38.610 --> 05:39.820
Father!

05:41.570 --> 05:44.449
By all means, make good use of her.

05:44.450 --> 05:49.420
I was getting sick of her singing, anyway.

05:59.160 --> 06:02.730
Something wrong, Pastor?
You lost again?

06:04.000 --> 06:06.220
You need me to show you the way?

06:06.590 --> 06:09.970
I'm afraid you have nothing to show me.

06:22.610 --> 06:26.239
What're you staring at,
you waterlogged corpse?! You wanna go?!

06:26.240 --> 06:27.620
Simmer down, Jihriel.

06:28.280 --> 06:28.490
SNIP

06:31.330 --> 06:33.329
I get it now!

06:33.330 --> 06:36.090
Right. It's more or less clear.

06:52.220 --> 06:54.980
They all made it past the spinal threads!

06:56.150 --> 06:57.909
But he blocked all their blows?!

06:57.910 --> 07:01.820
That bag of bones can use those
spinal threads reflexes to defend, too!

07:06.700 --> 07:11.659
A splendid blade catch.
But even if you can react to anything...

07:11.660 --> 07:14.209
you only have so many limbs.

07:14.210 --> 07:15.960
And right now, your hands are occupied.

07:16.410 --> 07:17.790
Entangled Poison Butterflies.

07:19.210 --> 07:22.960
- Ren, poison isn't going to affect a ghoul!
- Actually...

07:27.050 --> 07:28.220
It worked?!

07:28.670 --> 07:30.259
That was a neurotoxin.

07:30.260 --> 07:34.599
I'd wager that those spinal threads have a
direct connection to his own nervous system.

07:34.600 --> 07:35.189
TWITCH TWITCH

07:35.190 --> 07:42.360
And if you paralyze him, those mana-crafted
spinal threads will lose control as well.

07:44.170 --> 07:46.860
No more automatic reflexes for you!

07:47.380 --> 07:51.739
The paralysis won't last forever!
Finish him quickly, please!

07:51.740 --> 07:53.740
Got it!

08:00.080 --> 08:04.420
He can harden the spinal threads
and make them as sharp as a saw!

08:07.340 --> 08:12.259
Just spamming those things
would be plenty dangerous!

08:12.260 --> 08:15.310
Trying to buy time
until the paralysis works off, huh?

08:18.770 --> 08:22.520
Hundred Flowers Fist: Wrecking Wheels!

08:23.720 --> 08:25.400
I guess...

08:27.320 --> 08:28.949
you get to have the best part!

08:28.950 --> 08:30.820
TOSS
you get to have the best part!

08:31.850 --> 08:33.830
And I accept it.

08:34.580 --> 08:38.209
Pitiful undead, I will ferry
you to the other side...

08:38.210 --> 08:42.210
Leaving not even your regrets.

08:43.790 --> 08:46.210
House of Langlis, Dual Blade Craft,

08:46.600 --> 08:48.840
Lion Roar!

08:54.930 --> 08:56.220
Yes!

08:58.170 --> 09:00.120
That guy can kiss my butt!

09:02.920 --> 09:06.919
We did it! We beat him! Tao! Sylpha!

09:06.920 --> 09:11.319
No. His automatic reflexes came back
just before I struck him.

09:11.320 --> 09:15.239
I believe he was able to break
his fall. Not only that...

09:15.240 --> 09:18.039
FLIP FLOP
But considering my sword is still floppy...

09:18.040 --> 09:21.249
FLIP FLOP
You were fighting with that thing?!

09:21.250 --> 09:26.000
I had thought that Blighted
couldn't control their powers.

09:26.710 --> 09:31.090
But it seemed pretty clear
that he had complete control over his...

09:31.910 --> 09:36.260
This matter might be more
serious than I had thought.

09:36.750 --> 09:38.770
We can't afford to let him escape.

09:39.270 --> 09:44.610
It stands to reason I'd struggle with
a trio of adventurers who are that strong.

09:48.860 --> 09:53.410
The Master is still at the church.
But I'm worked up.

09:53.910 --> 09:56.480
Should I go have some fun on the surface?

09:57.870 --> 10:01.270
The day the Master is waiting for
is near...

10:02.460 --> 10:06.420
Until then, our little game
is on hold, adventurers.

10:06.800 --> 10:09.670
We'll meet again when the time is right.

10:22.390 --> 10:24.650
HAD TO GO POTTY —LLOYD

10:37.120 --> 10:39.990
I WAS REINCARNATED AS THE 7TH PRINCE SO I CAN TAKE
MY TIME PERFECTING MY MAGICAL ABILITY 2ND SEASON

10:43.800 --> 10:47.630
The word that best describes
my life would be "shit," I think.

10:48.150 --> 10:53.010
It consisted of being abused,
with no place to belong, before ending.

10:53.880 --> 10:57.600
Which explains how I ended up as a wraith.

10:58.030 --> 11:01.519
Ethereals can possess the bodies
of the living, controlling them.

11:01.520 --> 11:06.520
But in my case, that only worked
on those who were weak of spirit.

11:07.270 --> 11:10.229
There was no way I could
get revenge like that.

11:10.230 --> 11:14.190
And the spirits of strong bodies
proved to be too strong.

11:15.300 --> 11:19.529
That was when I met my Master...

11:19.530 --> 11:24.290
This body is quite the rare find that
I recently pieced back together.

11:24.960 --> 11:30.539
Civil War's body continued to wield
incredible power even after passing away...

11:30.540 --> 11:33.320
And it accepted me without resistance.

11:34.300 --> 11:40.760
Maybe we had something in common, having only
encountered abuse and suffering before death.

11:41.930 --> 11:44.560
That body is yours now.

11:45.060 --> 11:49.400
When I asked him what he wanted
in exchange, he laughed...

11:50.310 --> 11:54.320
Nothing, really.
Use it as you see fit.

11:54.730 --> 12:00.529
So, the first thing I did was slaughter
all the bastards who drove me to death.

12:00.530 --> 12:02.200
And after that...

12:03.580 --> 12:07.460
After that... I didn't have a plan.

12:08.250 --> 12:13.720
And Master said something that made me think
he knew it was going to turn out that way.

12:14.600 --> 12:16.220
Welcome home.

12:16.620 --> 12:21.220
It's such a common thing to say,
but it was like a whole new world to me...

12:24.070 --> 12:27.310
And he became the center of that world.

12:36.320 --> 12:40.070
I knew it. There was something
about him this entire time.

12:40.600 --> 12:43.429
He noticed my spinal threads
before anyone else,

12:43.430 --> 12:45.580
and even intentionally
made contact with one!

12:46.520 --> 12:48.920
The sensation I got from
connecting to him...

12:49.570 --> 12:52.580
was the kind of despair that
leaves you frozen in place.

12:53.000 --> 12:56.589
I was right.
Even if this was a nightmare...

12:56.590 --> 12:58.470
it'd be too much!

12:58.840 --> 13:02.849
This is impossible!
How can he have so much mana?!

13:02.850 --> 13:05.810
Don't hurt me! Let me go!

13:07.600 --> 13:10.100
I... I know.

13:10.810 --> 13:14.540
He's a threat to my master!

13:25.240 --> 13:27.869
I can fight fine with just one arm!

13:27.870 --> 13:33.709
There's no way these seven goddesses can
touch me with my automatic reflexes!

13:33.710 --> 13:38.459
React with my spinal cords...
with my soul! All for one goal!

13:38.460 --> 13:39.719
(Pretty)
Pretty.

13:39.720 --> 13:43.470
To smash this diabolical little
turd's skull into splinters!

13:47.430 --> 13:48.969
Are you serious?!

13:48.970 --> 13:50.930
What am I supposed to do?!

13:51.480 --> 13:53.980
What?!

13:55.480 --> 13:57.480
I...

13:57.900 --> 13:59.740
We...

14:00.360 --> 14:02.990
What should we have done?

14:12.160 --> 14:13.250
Good!

14:13.830 --> 14:16.749
He's finally stopped
reacting automatically.

14:16.750 --> 14:19.379
You're taking him in, aren't you?

14:19.380 --> 14:23.129
Where are you gonna stash him?
He can't go in the castle.

14:23.130 --> 14:25.179
What do you think Lordost is for?

14:25.180 --> 14:27.509
Wh-What are you...?

14:27.510 --> 14:29.099
I'm not sure why you'd ask that.

14:29.100 --> 14:32.479
A ghoul that can use an ability from
their time alive is incredibly rare!

14:32.480 --> 14:36.040
I need to take you home and see
how the mana signatures are interacting with...

14:36.520 --> 14:39.150
You can talk?!

14:39.710 --> 14:41.279
Uh... yeah.

14:41.280 --> 14:42.739
You should've said something!

14:42.740 --> 14:45.279
I probably did more damage
than I needed to!

14:45.280 --> 14:47.819
Seriously, how does your deal work?

14:47.820 --> 14:49.910
Do you remember your time alive?

14:50.730 --> 14:51.539
E-Excuse me?

14:51.540 --> 14:54.289
Boss, I think this dude might be a wraith.

14:54.290 --> 14:57.540
- Then you think a wraith possessed a corpse?
- What is this?

14:57.980 --> 15:00.209
Do you know your name?

15:00.210 --> 15:01.459
Prince Lloyd!

15:01.460 --> 15:03.919
These boobs... or rather,
this Luxa deserves a name!

15:03.920 --> 15:04.999
WOOO
I was thinking

15:05.000 --> 15:07.179
BOIIING
"The Divine Septuple" would be great!

15:07.180 --> 15:08.569
WOOO
What is... going on here?

15:08.570 --> 15:09.679
BOIIING
What is... going on here?

15:09.680 --> 15:12.020
I want to know all about you!

15:13.770 --> 15:15.270
Come with me.

15:22.940 --> 15:28.779
Are these tears mine?
Or yours, Civil War?

15:28.780 --> 15:31.909
Yeah, buddy, you've got real guts!

15:31.910 --> 15:35.540
Considering he fought Prince Lloyd
without running...

15:35.870 --> 15:37.039
Pure madness.

15:37.040 --> 15:38.669
What's that supposed to mean?

15:38.670 --> 15:43.050
They're right. Compared to the courage
I needed to challenge him...

15:43.610 --> 15:47.590
The struggles the world put
me through seem like nothing.

15:48.420 --> 15:54.930
And now the hand of someone I never
would've thought I could touch is so close...

15:55.400 --> 15:57.020
and warm.

15:58.620 --> 16:02.010
Thank you. And I'm sorry.

16:03.030 --> 16:08.360
This contains the divine spell
Luma Maxima.

16:08.820 --> 16:13.449
Once shattered, the rotten flesh you pilot,
as well as your ethereal body...

16:13.450 --> 16:16.250
will be eradicated in an instant.

16:17.770 --> 16:19.330
Swallow it.

16:38.540 --> 16:41.100
What's this? He stopped moving.

16:41.980 --> 16:44.610
Prince Lloyd, is Grim...?

16:45.010 --> 16:47.579
He'll be fine in a minute, don't worry.

16:47.580 --> 16:51.489
I'm more curious about that light.
It was divine sorcery, wasn't it?

16:51.490 --> 16:54.350
I believe so, but...

16:55.450 --> 16:58.620
How could either a ghoul or wraith
use divine sorcery?

16:59.250 --> 17:01.319
Especially Luma Maxima.

17:01.320 --> 17:04.630
That's an advanced spell
that only a few can cast!

17:08.010 --> 17:11.260
Please... see to my master...

17:14.630 --> 17:17.170
Your master, huh?

17:21.640 --> 17:24.900
Well, isn't that interesting?

17:28.110 --> 17:29.400
Escher.

17:29.820 --> 17:33.119
Can you carry the pastor
to the adventurer's guild?

17:33.120 --> 17:34.660
Actually, I have to insist you do.

17:35.130 --> 17:36.699
What about you, Babylon?

17:36.700 --> 17:39.160
I'll be fine. Go.

17:40.410 --> 17:42.670
And don't call for help.

17:51.320 --> 17:54.430
Good. Don't drag anyone else into this.

17:55.050 --> 17:58.180
Because no one can beat him.

18:00.440 --> 18:02.979
I don't know why he's frozen up,

18:02.980 --> 18:05.189
but Escher was able to escape
because of it.

18:05.190 --> 18:07.070
Civil War...

18:07.690 --> 18:08.199
NERVOUS...

18:08.200 --> 18:10.819
Just stay like that
until Escher gets away.

18:10.820 --> 18:14.220
Then I'll be able to run, too.

18:15.240 --> 18:16.199
URK!
The woman is gone, isn't she?

18:16.200 --> 18:17.450
The woman is gone, isn't she?

18:18.240 --> 18:20.999
Are you some kind of monster?

18:21.000 --> 18:24.849
Oh, this? Well, it's a long story.

18:24.850 --> 18:28.339
Do you really think you can brush aside
that morphing with, "It's a long story?!"

18:28.340 --> 18:30.460
I do. Considering...

18:31.410 --> 18:33.840
you're going to die.

18:36.650 --> 18:37.680
Babylon.

18:38.570 --> 18:40.950
I need you to stay behind at the church.

18:41.730 --> 18:44.349
I mean, even I realize
it's probably a bad idea

18:44.350 --> 18:47.559
for a prince to bunk off
the church after a single day.

18:47.560 --> 18:49.570
I need you to clean up after my mess.

18:50.480 --> 18:54.490
Besides, that pastor from before
caught your attention, right?

18:55.970 --> 18:58.369
You noticed something too, Prince Lloyd?

18:58.370 --> 19:01.329
Anything I noticed is secondary.

19:01.330 --> 19:04.750
What's important is that
you noticed something.

19:05.580 --> 19:09.249
All I am is a seventh prince,
and a magic maniac.

19:09.250 --> 19:13.090
I haven't lived my life dodging
death the way you all have.

19:13.550 --> 19:18.850
That's resulted in you having something
I don't—a sensitivity to danger.

19:19.400 --> 19:21.889
I could be imagining things.

19:21.890 --> 19:24.100
Hey, how would no trouble be a bad thing?

19:24.650 --> 19:27.650
It could have nothing to do with sorcery.

19:28.110 --> 19:32.360
I find that everything has
something to do with sorcery.

19:35.800 --> 19:38.870
People live for dreams,
and magic is the stuff of dreams!

19:43.410 --> 19:47.480
Take care of things around here, Babylon.

19:50.340 --> 19:54.339
I'm not sure why,
but I'm not feeling much fear.

19:54.340 --> 19:57.590
Is it because I can't tell exactly
how much stronger than me he is?

19:58.140 --> 20:02.720
Or could it be the lack of
bloodlust I sense from him?

20:07.730 --> 20:11.980
Despite the fact that he's
definitely trying to kill me.

20:14.990 --> 20:17.490
What's going on with me right now?

20:19.340 --> 20:21.830
Am I not afraid because
none of this makes sense?

20:26.520 --> 20:28.119
Or maybe I should ask...

20:28.120 --> 20:31.130
What kind of buff did he hit me with?

20:33.420 --> 20:35.510
Because I'm feeling
plenty brave right now.

20:42.190 --> 20:44.759
There's no way I can
physically restrain him.

20:44.760 --> 20:48.389
Any knife strikes I slip past his
defenses will regenerate instantly.

20:48.390 --> 20:52.810
If I can stop this guy,
there's only one way...

20:54.070 --> 20:56.990
The Purifying-class spell, Glow!

20:58.700 --> 21:02.570
A change of heart could end this game...

21:03.830 --> 21:08.580
Except for the fact that I don't have enough
mana to accomplish that with a single blast.

21:09.210 --> 21:11.580
Which is why I'll keep casting!

21:13.420 --> 21:16.759
Purifying sorcery is more practical
for battle than you'd think.

21:16.760 --> 21:20.840
The flash of light blinds the enemy,
keeping your position hidden.

21:21.340 --> 21:23.850
And their heart becomes
an exposed weakness!

21:24.320 --> 21:25.559
How's that?!

21:25.560 --> 21:29.350
This light works offensively and defensively,
and you can't guard against it!

21:31.270 --> 21:33.860
Maybe you'll feel like
talking this over...

21:41.240 --> 21:42.489
SNIFF SNIFF

21:42.490 --> 21:46.240
Oh, he noticed my position from my scent.

21:49.370 --> 21:51.040
The heart, eh?

21:51.710 --> 21:55.920
You'll find there's nothing to
be gained by targeting mine.

22:09.180 --> 22:10.980
I told you as much...

22:12.710 --> 22:15.710
You have nothing to show me.

23:50.700 --> 23:54.159
An apex that I couldn't even
touch with instant reflexes!

23:54.160 --> 23:56.919
Did a calcium deficiency
play into my defeat?

23:56.920 --> 23:58.789
Next time, on Episode 17:

23:58.790 --> 24:00.419
EPISODE 17: THE CHURCH'S SECRET
"The Church's Secret."

24:00.420 --> 24:03.629
EPISODE 17: THE CHURCH'S SECRET
You will witness the depths of sorcery.

24:03.630 --> 24:05.010
EPISODE 17: THE CHURCH'S SECRET
